{
    "title": "IPSY: Personalized Beauty",
    "description": "Discover personalized beauty products and express your unique beauty with IPSY! Home to Glam Bag, BoxyCharm, and Icon Box, IPSY is beauty\u2019s best-kept secret. All you have to do is take a quick quiz about your preferences (think: skin concerns, hair type, favorite makeup products, and more), and then we match you with the best products for you. Think of us as your go-to for insane insider prices on buzzworthy beauty that\u2019s personalized for you, so you can play, explore, and express what makes you unique every day. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re looking to discover unbeatable deals on makeup, skincare, and more; the hottest brands; or a subscription you can truly customize to your beauty preferences and goals, you\u2019re in the right place. As the leading source of beauty discovery, education, and inspiration, IPSY combines personalized products and tips, tricks, and tutorials with member-exclusive deals and shopping events to create the ultimate beauty membership.\r\n\r\nFrom well-known and well-loved makeup brands to new, emerging beauty brands from around the world, IPSY brings you the very best in makeup, skincare, body care, fragrance, hair care, nails, and beauty tools.  We\u2019re talking NARS, BENEFIT COSMETICS, FENTY BEAUTY, M\u00b7A\u00b7C, ANASTASIA BEVERLY HILLS, SMASHBOX COSMETICS, TARTE, HUDA BEAUTY, IT COSMETICS, GLOW RECIPE, and so many more.  \r\n\r\nOur free mobile app is the best way to experience IPSY:\r\n\u2022 Choose your products every month (1 for your Glam Bag and 3 for your BoxyCharm and Icon Box!).\r\n\u2022 Get first dibs on a premium, splurge-worthy bonus full-size product by adding a Beauty Boost upgrade to your membership (you can even swap it for a full-size product you love more!).\r\n\u2022 See all your personalized products before they land on your doorstep.\r\n\u2022 Discover and learn more about your picks with the thousands of makeup tutorials, face charts, and step-by-step guides we\u2019ve put together to help you create endless looks.\r\n\u2022 Shop exclusive, members-only sales and save up to 80% on top brands and hot products in our 24/7 IPSY Shop, quarterly Mega Drop Shop, or limited-time-only Flash sales.\r\n\u2022 Review your products to make your future picks even better. The longer you\u2019re with us (and the more we get to know you), the more we can personalize the best products for you.\r\n\r\nJoin the IPSY fam and discover what it\u2019s like to be part of something beautiful\u2014a community that champions self-expression and is with you every step of your beauty journey, no matter what it looks like.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover personalized beauty products and express your unique beauty with IPSY! Home to Glam Bag, BoxyCharm, and Icon Box, IPSY is beauty\u2019s best-kept secret. All you have to do is take a quick quiz about your preferences (think: skin concerns, hair type, favorite makeup products, and more), and then we match you with the best products for you. Think of us as your go-to for insane insider prices on buzzworthy beauty that\u2019s personalized for you, so you can play, explore, and express what makes you unique every day. <br><br>Whether you\u2019re looking to discover unbeatable deals on makeup, skincare, and more; the hottest brands; or a subscription you can truly customize to your beauty preferences and goals, you\u2019re in the right place. As the leading source of beauty discovery, education, and inspiration, IPSY combines personalized products and tips, tricks, and tutorials with member-exclusive deals and shopping events to create the ultimate beauty membership.<br><br>From well-known and well-loved makeup brands to new, emerging beauty brands from around the world, IPSY brings you the very best in makeup, skincare, body care, fragrance, hair care, nails, and beauty tools.  We\u2019re talking NARS, BENEFIT COSMETICS, FENTY BEAUTY, M\u00b7A\u00b7C, ANASTASIA BEVERLY HILLS, SMASHBOX COSMETICS, TARTE, HUDA BEAUTY, IT COSMETICS, GLOW RECIPE, and so many more.  <br><br>Our free mobile app is the best way to experience IPSY:<br>\u2022 Choose your products every month (1 for your Glam Bag and 3 for your BoxyCharm and Icon Box!).<br>\u2022 Get first dibs on a premium, splurge-worthy bonus full-size product by adding a Beauty Boost upgrade to your membership (you can even swap it for a full-size product you love more!).<br>\u2022 See all your personalized products before they land on your doorstep.<br>\u2022 Discover and learn more about your picks with the thousands of makeup tutorials, face charts, and step-by-step guides we\u2019ve put together to help you create endless looks.<br>\u2022 Shop exclusive, members-only sales and save up to 80% on top brands and hot products in our 24/7 IPSY Shop, quarterly Mega Drop Shop, or limited-time-only Flash sales.<br>\u2022 Review your products to make your future picks even better. The longer you\u2019re with us (and the more we get to know you), the more we can personalize the best products for you.<br><br>Join the IPSY fam and discover what it\u2019s like to be part of something beautiful\u2014a community that champions self-expression and is with you every step of your beauty journey, no matter what it looks like.",
